resolve: figref refid="nocap": the figure has no figcap
resolve: figref refid="intro": refers to a h1, not a figure
resolve: liref refid="bullet": not an ordered list item
resolve: liref refid="missing": no such id
resolve: fnref refid="nofn": no such id
resolve: hdref refid="f2": refers to a fig, not a heading
